  /* The barrel radius lives in the ROTATION AXIS (transform-origin's z), not in a
   * translateZ on the faces. Pushing the faces forward with translateZ would put
   * them closer to the viewer, and perspective would magnify them ~32% at rest —
   * every glyph would overflow its own cell and collide with its neighbours.
   * Recessing the axis instead leaves each face at z:0 when it is face-on, so it
   * renders exactly at its layout size, while still sweeping a cylinder. */
  .ds-roll-hover-out,
